---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date('2026-07-24');
---

<PageLayout
	title="Now | Itziar Morales"
	description="What I'm doing these days — a now page."
>
	<p class="eyebrow">~/now</p>
	<h1>Now</h1>
	<p class="updated">
		Last updated <time datetime={updated.toISOString().slice(0, 10)}>
			{updated.toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' })}
		</time> · this is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">now page</a>
	</p>

	<h2>Working</h2>
	<p>
		Interning remotely at MGA, deep in the data-engineering side of a digital transformation:
		relational schema design, migrating years of spreadsheet data into PostgreSQL, and Spring Boot
		services on top. Learning a lot about the gap between how a business says it works and what its
		data actually does.
	</p>

	<h2>Studying</h2>
	<p>
		Final year of Software Engineering at U-tad starts in September. Thesis brewing on the same theme
		as the internship: how you replace legacy spreadsheet workflows without breaking the people who
		rely on them.
	</p>
	<p>On the side:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/spring-hibernate-tutorial/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spring &amp; Hibernate</a> (Udemy) &mdash; backend upskilling for work</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/sql-and-postgresql/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SQL &amp; PostgreSQL</a> (Udemy) &mdash; same mission, database side</li>
		<li>French &mdash; chipping away, aiming for a DELF B1 later next year</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Building</h2>
	<p>
		Slowly rewriting <a href="https://github.com/itzi97/engine2d" target="_blank" rel="noopener">engine2d</a> —
		the flat ECS is in, spatial hashing for the broadphase is next.
	</p>

	<h2>Playing</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://www.grimdawn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Grim Dawn</a> &mdash; first run, base game, no DLCs yet</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.square-enix.com/ffvii/en-us/games/remake-intergrade/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Final Fantasy VII Remake Intergrade</a> &mdash; working through it</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.dofus.com/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dofus</a> &mdash; my childhood MMORPG, currently in its Dofus&nbsp;3 incarnation</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Reading</h2>
	<p>
		<em>Dragon Rider</em> by Cornelia Funke.
	</p>

	<h2>Practicing</h2>
	<p>On the piano at the moment:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Chopin &mdash; Waltz in C&sharp; minor, Op.&nbsp;64 No.&nbsp;2</li>
		<li>Chopin &mdash; Waltz in A minor</li>
		<li>Mozart &mdash; Sonata in C, K.&nbsp;545</li>
	</ul>

	<style>
		.eyebrow {
			font-family: var(--font-mono);
			color: var(--accent);
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
			margin-top: 0;
		}
		.updated {
			color: var(--text-muted);
			font-size: 0.85em;
		}
		h2 {
			font-size: 1.1em;
			margin-top: 1.6em;
		}
		ul {
			padding-left: 1.25em;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.3em;
		}
		li {
			font-size: 0.92em;
		}
	</style>
</PageLayout>
